WEBVTT

00:01:40.715 --> 00:01:42.115
dean:
look,dad's gone now.

00:01:42.155 --> 00:01:43.615
we have to carry out his legacy,

00:01:43.655 --> 00:01:46.015
and that means hunting down
as many evil sons of bitches

00:01:46.055 --> 00:01:47.685
as we possibly can.

00:01:51.555 --> 00:01:52.985
whoops.

00:02:46.155 --> 00:02:48.385
let me guess -- you're
offering up your own soul?

00:02:48.415 --> 00:02:49.785
all you got to do
is bring sam back.

00:02:49.815 --> 00:02:52.055
i'll give you one year
and one year only.

00:02:52.085 --> 00:02:55.015
if you try and weasel your way
out,then the deal is off.

00:02:57.415 --> 00:02:59.355
yellow-eyed demon:
how certain are you

00:02:59.385 --> 00:03:03.415
that what you brought back
is 100% pure sam?

00:03:10.155 --> 00:03:11.915
what the hell
just happened?

00:03:11.955 --> 00:03:14.915
that's a devil's gate,
a damn door to hell!

00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:18.755
hope to hell
you boys are ready

00:03:18.785 --> 00:03:20.455
'cause the war
has just begun.

00:06:23.715 --> 00:06:25.815
sam: hello.

00:06:25.855 --> 00:06:26.815
hey,sam.

00:06:26.855 --> 00:06:28.655
hey,bobby.
what you doing?

00:06:28.685 --> 00:06:30.085
oh,same old,same old.

00:06:30.115 --> 00:06:32.185
you buried
in that book again?

00:06:32.215 --> 00:06:36.015
sam,you want to break dean free
of that demon deal,

00:06:36.055 --> 00:06:38.315
you ain't gonna find the answer
in no book.

00:06:38.355 --> 00:06:39.615
then where,bobby?

00:06:39.655 --> 00:06:41.985
kid,i wish i knew.

00:06:42.015 --> 00:06:45.015
so,where's your brother?

00:06:45.055 --> 00:06:47.185
polling the electorate.
what?

00:06:47.215 --> 00:06:49.455
never mind.
well,you boys better
pack it up.

00:06:49.485 --> 00:06:51.685
i think i finally
found something.

00:06:51.715 --> 00:06:54.315
* she looked at me
with big brown eyes *
[ knock on door ]

00:06:54.355 --> 00:06:57.355
dean?
* and said,
"you ain't seen nothing yet" *

00:06:57.385 --> 00:06:59.285
dean,you -- you conscious?

00:06:59.315 --> 00:07:02.315
bobby called,
and he thinks that maybe we --

00:07:02.355 --> 00:07:04.085
oh,god.

00:07:09.385 --> 00:07:11.115
let me see your knife.

00:07:11.155 --> 00:07:12.415
what for?

00:07:12.455 --> 00:07:14.155
so i can gouge my eyes out.

00:07:15.515 --> 00:07:17.555
it was a beautiful,
natural act,sam.

00:07:17.585 --> 00:07:20.415
it's a part of you i never
wanted to see,dean.

00:07:21.815 --> 00:07:23.985
hey,i appreciate you giving me
a little quality time

00:07:24.015 --> 00:07:25.315
with the doublemint twins.

00:07:25.355 --> 00:07:27.615
no problem.

00:07:27.655 --> 00:07:29.015
really?

00:07:29.055 --> 00:07:30.515
well,i got to say,

00:07:30.555 --> 00:07:33.985
i was expecting a weary sigh
or an eye roll,something.

00:07:34.015 --> 00:07:36.015
not at all. you deserve
to have a little fun.

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:38.885
well,i'm in violent agreement
with you there.

00:07:38.915 --> 00:07:41.615
[ chuckles ]
what's bobby got?
not much.

00:07:41.655 --> 00:07:43.985
crop failure and a cicada swarm
outside of lincoln,nebraska.

00:07:44.015 --> 00:07:45.685
could be demonic omens.

00:07:45.715 --> 00:07:48.485
or could just be a bad crop
and a bug problem.
but it's our only lead.

00:07:48.515 --> 00:07:51.415
any freaky deaths?
nothing bobby could find --
not yet,anyway.

00:07:51.455 --> 00:07:53.615
it's weird,man. the night
the devil's gate opened,

00:07:53.655 --> 00:07:55.115
all these weirdo
storm clouds

00:07:55.155 --> 00:07:56.415
were sighted
over how many cities?

00:07:56.455 --> 00:07:57.555
17.
17.

00:07:57.585 --> 00:07:59.215
you think it would be
"apocalypse now,"

00:07:59.255 --> 00:08:02.015
but it's been five days
and bubkes.

00:08:03.855 --> 00:08:05.155
what are the demons
waiting for?

00:08:05.185 --> 00:08:06.785
beats me.

00:08:06.815 --> 00:08:07.915
driving me crazy.

00:08:07.955 --> 00:08:09.385
i tell you,
if it's gonna be war,

00:08:09.415 --> 00:08:10.915
i wish it would just
start already.

00:08:10.955 --> 00:08:12.385
be careful
what you wish for.

00:08:27.955 --> 00:08:29.315
hear those cicadas?

00:08:29.355 --> 00:08:31.755
that can't be
a good sign.

00:08:31.785 --> 00:08:33.385
no. no,it can't.

00:08:37.415 --> 00:08:39.485
so,we're eating
bacon cheeseburgers

00:08:39.515 --> 00:08:41.285
for breakfast,are we?

00:08:41.315 --> 00:08:44.585
well,sold my soul.
got a year to live.

00:08:44.615 --> 00:08:47.185
i ain't sweating
the cholesterol.

00:08:47.215 --> 00:08:48.515
so,bobby,
what do you think?

00:08:48.555 --> 00:08:50.015
we got a biblical plague here
or what?

00:08:50.055 --> 00:08:51.485
well,let's find out.

00:08:51.515 --> 00:08:53.685
looks like the swarm's
ground zero.

00:08:55.615 --> 00:08:57.915
candygram!

00:09:13.715 --> 00:09:15.485
that's awful.

00:09:15.515 --> 00:09:17.785
<i>that so can't be
a good sign.</i>

00:09:50.715 --> 00:09:52.515
you hear that?

00:10:06.385 --> 00:10:08.485
<i>this is supposed to be
my birthday party.</i>

00:10:08.515 --> 00:10:09.585
oh,my god.

00:10:19.885 --> 00:10:24.015
<i>grandma is making out
the invitation list.</i>

00:10:24.055 --> 00:10:26.055
<i>sue ellen is gonna hire...</i>

00:10:26.085 --> 00:10:28.455
bobby,what the hell
happened here?
i don't know.

00:10:28.485 --> 00:10:29.815
<i>and j.r.'s gonna use it...</i>

00:10:29.855 --> 00:10:31.415
check for sulfur.

00:10:31.455 --> 00:10:33.155
<i>...for one of his big deals!</i>

00:10:33.185 --> 00:10:36.455
<i>and now you're gonna buy
my clothes!</i>

00:10:36.485 --> 00:10:39.355
<i>i hate this family!</i>

00:11:31.455 --> 00:11:34.255
bobby: isaac? tamara?

00:11:35.855 --> 00:11:36.915
[ british accent ]
bobby.

00:11:36.955 --> 00:11:38.255
what the hell are you
doing here?

00:11:38.285 --> 00:11:39.355
i could ask the same.

00:11:39.385 --> 00:11:41.085
heya,bobby.

00:11:41.115 --> 00:11:44.215
hello. bleeding here.

00:11:47.685 --> 00:11:50.015
bobby: isaac,you sure got
some nice digs here.

00:11:50.055 --> 00:11:51.655
yeah.
if i can find anything.

00:11:51.685 --> 00:11:55.515
honey...
where's the palo santo?

00:11:55.555 --> 00:11:57.055
well,where'd you leave it?

00:11:57.085 --> 00:12:00.055
i don't know,dear.
that's why i'm asking.

00:12:00.085 --> 00:12:01.515
palo santo?

00:12:01.555 --> 00:12:04.015
it's holy wood from peru.

00:12:04.055 --> 00:12:07.715
it's toxic to demons
like holy water.

00:12:07.755 --> 00:12:11.385
keeps the bastards nailed down
while you're exorcising them.

00:12:11.415 --> 00:12:12.985
thank you,dear.

00:12:13.015 --> 00:12:16.585
you'd lose your head
if it wasn't for me.

00:12:16.615 --> 00:12:18.855
so,how long you two
been married?

00:12:18.885 --> 00:12:20.885
eight years
this past june.

00:12:22.285 --> 00:12:23.885
the family
that slays together...

00:12:23.915 --> 00:12:25.355
right.
i'm with you there.

00:12:25.385 --> 00:12:26.685
so,how'd you get started?

00:12:32.985 --> 00:12:35.285
oh,you know...
i'm sorry.

00:12:35.315 --> 00:12:37.715
it's not --
that's none of my business.

00:12:37.755 --> 00:12:39.585
it's -- it's all right.

00:12:39.615 --> 00:12:43.355
well,jenny,if you look
as pretty as you sound,

00:12:43.385 --> 00:12:47.055
<i>then i'd love to have
an appletini.</i>

00:12:47.085 --> 00:12:48.715
yeah. call you.

00:12:48.755 --> 00:12:51.615
that was
the coroner's tech.
and?

00:12:51.655 --> 00:12:54.455
get this -- that whole family,
'cause of death --

00:12:54.485 --> 00:12:56.385
dehydration and starvation.

00:12:56.415 --> 00:12:58.715
there's no signs of restraint,
no violence,no struggle.

00:12:58.755 --> 00:13:00.355
they just sat down
and never got up.

00:13:00.385 --> 00:13:02.615
but there was a fully stocked
kitchen just yards away.

00:13:02.655 --> 00:13:04.015
what is this,
a demon attack?

00:13:04.055 --> 00:13:06.285
if it is,it's not like
anything i ever saw,

00:13:06.315 --> 00:13:07.385
and i've seen plenty.

00:13:07.415 --> 00:13:09.185
what now?
what should we do?

00:13:09.215 --> 00:13:11.055
<i>uh,we're not gonna
do anything.</i>

00:13:11.085 --> 00:13:12.255
what do you mean?

00:13:12.285 --> 00:13:13.485
you guys seem nice enough,

00:13:13.515 --> 00:13:14.955
but this ain't
"scooby-doo,"

00:13:14.985 --> 00:13:16.685
and we don't play well
with others.

00:13:16.715 --> 00:13:19.185
we'd cover a lot more ground
if we all worked together.

00:13:19.215 --> 00:13:21.455
no offense,but we're not
teaming with the damn fools

00:13:21.485 --> 00:13:23.785
who let the devil's gate
get open in the first place.

00:13:23.815 --> 00:13:25.585
no offense?

00:13:25.615 --> 00:13:27.815
isaac,like you've never made
a mistake.

00:13:27.855 --> 00:13:30.785
yeah,locked my keys in the car,
turned my laundry pink.

00:13:30.815 --> 00:13:33.285
never brought on the end
of the world,though.

00:13:33.315 --> 00:13:34.885
[ chuckles ]
all right. that's enough.

00:13:34.915 --> 00:13:36.485
guys,this isn't helping.
dean --

00:13:36.515 --> 00:13:39.485
look,there are couple hundred
more demons out there now.

00:13:39.515 --> 00:13:41.715
we don't know where they are,
when they'll strike.

00:13:41.755 --> 00:13:43.755
there ain't enough hunters
in the world

00:13:43.785 --> 00:13:45.415
to handle something
like this.

00:13:45.455 --> 00:13:48.385
<i>you brought war down on us --
on all of us.</i>

00:13:48.415 --> 00:13:51.585
okay. that's quite enough
testosterone for now.

00:14:47.085 --> 00:14:48.685
excuse me.

00:14:48.715 --> 00:14:49.685
yes?

00:14:51.555 --> 00:14:53.615
those are...nice shoes.

00:14:55.215 --> 00:14:58.455
<i>oh,yeah.
they are nice.</i>

00:15:05.115 --> 00:15:06.615
those are nice shoes.

00:15:06.655 --> 00:15:08.285
aren't they?

00:15:09.615 --> 00:15:10.915
i want them.

00:15:10.955 --> 00:15:12.455
sorry. last pair.

00:15:22.085 --> 00:15:24.355
excuse me.

00:15:24.385 --> 00:15:25.515
i want those shoes.

00:15:25.555 --> 00:15:29.085
what,are you crazy?
no. what?

00:15:58.815 --> 00:16:00.955
dean: what happened outside
makes you realize

00:16:00.985 --> 00:16:02.255
how fragile life really is.

00:16:02.285 --> 00:16:05.355
you got to make
every second count.

00:16:07.055 --> 00:16:08.785
excuse me a minute,
would you?

00:16:08.815 --> 00:16:09.785
sure.

00:16:11.115 --> 00:16:12.485
dean,what are you doing?

00:16:12.515 --> 00:16:14.355
i'm comforting
the bereaved.

00:16:14.385 --> 00:16:15.455
<i>what are you doing?</i>

00:16:15.485 --> 00:16:16.485
working.

00:16:16.515 --> 00:16:18.515
dead body,
possible demon attack --

00:16:18.555 --> 00:16:19.685
that kind of stuff.

00:16:19.715 --> 00:16:21.115
sam,i'm sorry.

00:16:21.155 --> 00:16:23.485
it's just i don't have
much time left,and...

00:16:24.685 --> 00:16:27.055
...got to make
every second count.

00:16:27.085 --> 00:16:29.285
yeah,right. sorry.

00:16:29.315 --> 00:16:30.715
apology accepted.

00:16:30.755 --> 00:16:33.285
whoa. [ whistles ]
looking spiffy,bobby.

00:16:33.315 --> 00:16:34.715
what were you,a g-man?

00:16:34.755 --> 00:16:36.715
attorney
for the d.a.'s office.

00:16:36.755 --> 00:16:38.455
i just spoke
to the suspect.

00:16:38.485 --> 00:16:41.185
yeah? so,what do you think?
is she possessed or what?

00:16:41.215 --> 00:16:42.415
don't think so.

00:16:42.455 --> 00:16:44.215
there's none
of the usual signs --

00:16:44.255 --> 00:16:46.885
no blackouts,
no loss of control.

00:16:46.915 --> 00:16:48.385
totally lucid.

00:16:48.415 --> 00:16:51.115
<i>just,she really wanted
those shoes.</i>

00:16:51.155 --> 00:16:54.255
spilled a glass of holy water
on her just to be sure.

00:16:54.285 --> 00:16:55.885
nothing.

00:16:55.915 --> 00:16:57.885
maybe she's just some
random wack job.

00:16:57.915 --> 00:17:00.115
if it had been an isolated
incident,maybe,

00:17:00.155 --> 00:17:01.815
but first the family,
now this?

00:17:01.855 --> 00:17:03.485
i believe
in a lot of things.

00:17:03.515 --> 00:17:04.985
coincidence
ain't one of them.

00:17:05.015 --> 00:17:07.355
did you boys find anything
around here?

00:17:07.385 --> 00:17:08.684
no sulfur,nothing.

00:17:08.715 --> 00:17:10.914
well,maybe something.

00:17:14.315 --> 00:17:16.914
see? i'm working.

00:17:18.255 --> 00:17:19.985
anything interesting?

00:17:20.015 --> 00:17:21.315
i don't know yet.

00:17:21.355 --> 00:17:23.055
might just be a guy...

00:17:23.085 --> 00:17:25.155
or it might be our guy.

00:18:03.215 --> 00:18:05.555
what time is it?

00:18:05.585 --> 00:18:07.515
seven past midnight.

00:18:08.815 --> 00:18:11.155
you sure this is
the right place?
no.

00:18:11.184 --> 00:18:13.655
but i spent all day canvassing
this stupid town

00:18:13.684 --> 00:18:15.914
with this guy's stupid mug,

00:18:15.955 --> 00:18:19.385
and,supposedly,
he drinks at this stupid bar.

00:18:22.385 --> 00:18:23.585
that's not funny!

00:18:23.615 --> 00:18:26.755
yeah.
uh,all right,so --

00:18:26.785 --> 00:18:29.684
so,john doe's name
is walter rosen.

00:18:29.715 --> 00:18:31.615
he's from oak park,
just west of chicago.

00:18:31.655 --> 00:18:33.155
went missing
about a week ago.

00:18:33.184 --> 00:18:35.385
the night
the devil's gate opened?
yeah.

00:18:35.414 --> 00:18:37.415
so you think
he's possessed?
it's a good bet.

00:18:37.455 --> 00:18:39.955
so,what,he just walks up
to someone,touches them,

00:18:39.985 --> 00:18:41.655
and they go
stark raving psycho?

00:18:41.685 --> 00:18:43.315
those demons that got out
at the gate --

00:18:43.355 --> 00:18:45.615
they're gonna do all kinds
of things we haven't seen.

00:18:45.655 --> 00:18:47.215
<i>you mean the demons
we let out?</i>

00:18:47.255 --> 00:18:49.255
guys.

00:18:53.285 --> 00:18:55.315
all right. showtime.

00:18:55.355 --> 00:18:56.715
wait a minute.
what?

00:18:56.755 --> 00:18:57.855
what did i just say?

00:18:57.885 --> 00:19:00.215
we don't know what to expect
out of this guy.

00:19:00.255 --> 00:19:02.485
we should tail him
till we know for sure.

00:19:02.515 --> 00:19:04.655
oh,so he kills someone
and we just sit here?

00:19:04.685 --> 00:19:06.355
we're no good dead!

00:19:06.385 --> 00:19:08.355
and we're not gonna make
a move

00:19:08.385 --> 00:19:09.955
until we know
what the score is.

00:19:09.985 --> 00:19:12.285
hey,bobby,i don't think
that's an option.

00:19:12.315 --> 00:19:13.415
why not?

00:19:20.355 --> 00:19:21.415
damn it!

00:19:30.085 --> 00:19:31.115
thanks.

00:19:31.155 --> 00:19:32.285
you're welcome.

00:19:55.555 --> 00:19:58.155
pull the car in back.

00:19:58.185 --> 00:20:00.855
we'll be right out.

00:20:00.885 --> 00:20:03.085
i love you.

00:20:03.115 --> 00:20:04.615
i know.

00:20:10.885 --> 00:20:12.355
what do you think
you're doing?

00:20:13.555 --> 00:20:15.355
i'm just hitting the head.

00:20:15.385 --> 00:20:16.615
no.

00:20:16.655 --> 00:20:20.985
<i>i mean,what do you think
you're doing here?</i>

00:20:23.515 --> 00:20:26.655
i don't like hunters
in my bar.

00:20:45.515 --> 00:20:49.615
<i>man,you really walked
into the wrong place.</i>

00:20:52.735 --> 00:20:55.135
hold on.
i like the girl.

00:20:55.935 --> 00:20:58.535
<i>wish i had me a girl
like that.</i>

00:20:58.565 --> 00:21:01.865
i can think of about a thousand
things i'd like to do to her.

00:21:01.905 --> 00:21:04.505
you're not gonna lay
one filthy finger on her!

00:21:04.535 --> 00:21:06.035
i got something for you.

00:21:07.765 --> 00:21:11.135
here.
have a drink on me,hmm?

00:21:12.605 --> 00:21:14.235
isaac?

00:21:18.635 --> 00:21:19.665
on the house!

00:21:26.065 --> 00:21:28.105
isaac!

00:21:28.135 --> 00:21:29.835
isaac,no!

00:21:29.865 --> 00:21:32.635
baby,please!

00:21:46.005 --> 00:21:48.365
oh,he's down!

00:21:48.405 --> 00:21:50.705
all right,honey.
your turn!

00:21:50.735 --> 00:21:52.865
[ tires screeching ]

00:22:02.605 --> 00:22:05.235
come on,we got to go!
he's dead!

00:22:05.265 --> 00:22:06.565
get in the car!

00:22:12.105 --> 00:22:14.135
dean,come on!

00:22:29.165 --> 00:22:30.435
aah!

00:22:30.465 --> 00:22:32.965
go,go,go,go,
go,go,go,go!

00:22:44.805 --> 00:22:47.905
tamara: and i say
we're going back -- now!

00:22:47.935 --> 00:22:49.105
sam: hold on a second.

00:22:49.135 --> 00:22:51.165
i left my husband bloody
on the floor!

00:22:51.205 --> 00:22:53.535
okay,i understand that,
but we can't go back.

00:22:53.565 --> 00:22:56.035
fine. then you stay.

00:22:56.065 --> 00:22:57.565
but i'm heading back
to that bar.

00:22:57.605 --> 00:22:58.905
i'll go with her.

00:22:58.935 --> 00:23:00.065
it's suicide,dean!

00:23:00.105 --> 00:23:02.735
so what?
i'm dead already!

00:23:02.765 --> 00:23:05.635
how you gonna kill 'em?
can't shoot 'em.

00:23:05.665 --> 00:23:06.935
you can't stab 'em.

00:23:06.965 --> 00:23:09.165
they're not just gonna wait
in line to get exorcised!

00:23:09.205 --> 00:23:10.405
i don't care!

00:23:10.435 --> 00:23:12.765
we don't even know how many
of them there are!

00:23:12.805 --> 00:23:14.865
yeah,we do.
there's seven.

00:23:14.905 --> 00:23:18.405
do you have any idea
who we're up against?

00:23:18.435 --> 00:23:19.835
no. who?

00:23:19.865 --> 00:23:24.835
the seven deadly sins,
live and in the flesh!

00:23:27.105 --> 00:23:30.205
"what's in the box?!"

00:23:31.935 --> 00:23:34.805
brad pitt,"se7en"?
no?

00:23:37.935 --> 00:23:39.265
what's this?

00:23:39.305 --> 00:23:40.905
"binsfeld's classification
of demons."

00:23:40.935 --> 00:23:44.665
in 1589,binsfeld
i.d.'d the seven sins --

00:23:44.705 --> 00:23:48.205
not just as human vices
but as actual devils.

00:23:48.235 --> 00:23:51.335
the family --
they were touched by sloth.

00:23:51.365 --> 00:23:52.635
and the shopper...

00:23:52.665 --> 00:23:53.965
that's envy's doing --

00:23:54.005 --> 00:23:56.235
the customer we got
in the next room.

00:23:56.265 --> 00:23:58.835
i couldn't suss it out at first
until isaac.

00:23:58.865 --> 00:24:01.065
he was touched
with an awful gluttony.

00:24:01.105 --> 00:24:02.435
i don't give a rat's ass

00:24:02.465 --> 00:24:04.835
if they're the three stooges
or the four tops!

00:24:04.865 --> 00:24:07.865
i'm gonna slaughter
every last one of them!

00:24:07.905 --> 00:24:09.835
<i>we already did it your way.</i>

00:24:09.865 --> 00:24:13.105
you burst in there half-cocked
and look what happened!

00:24:13.135 --> 00:24:16.735
these demons haven't been
topside in half a millennium!

00:24:16.765 --> 00:24:19.065
we're talking medieval,
dark ages!

00:24:19.105 --> 00:24:21.765
we've never faced anything
close to this!

00:24:21.805 --> 00:24:24.005
so we are gonna
take a breath...

00:24:24.035 --> 00:24:26.835
and figure out
what our next move is!

00:24:32.735 --> 00:24:35.865
i am sorry for your loss.

00:24:53.105 --> 00:24:55.565
so you know who i am,huh?

00:24:55.605 --> 00:24:58.065
we do.
we're not impressed.

00:24:58.105 --> 00:25:02.505
why are you here?
what are you after?

00:25:02.535 --> 00:25:05.565
he asked you a question.

00:25:07.235 --> 00:25:08.565
what do you want?

00:25:14.365 --> 00:25:17.335
ya! ohh!

00:25:21.535 --> 00:25:24.365
we already have...

00:25:24.405 --> 00:25:26.835
what we want.

00:25:27.965 --> 00:25:29.135
what's that?

00:25:30.235 --> 00:25:31.705
we're out.

00:25:33.435 --> 00:25:35.305
we're free.

00:25:35.335 --> 00:25:38.965
thanks to you,
my kind are everywhere.

00:25:40.035 --> 00:25:43.935
i am legion,
for we are many.

00:25:45.435 --> 00:25:47.865
so me,
i'm just celebrating.

00:25:47.905 --> 00:25:49.965
having a little fun.

00:25:50.005 --> 00:25:51.905
fun?

00:25:51.935 --> 00:25:54.535
yeah. fun.

00:25:54.565 --> 00:25:58.465
see,some people crochet.
others golf.

00:25:58.505 --> 00:26:00.035
me?

00:26:00.065 --> 00:26:03.935
i like to see
people's insides...

00:26:03.965 --> 00:26:05.465
on their outside.

00:26:08.805 --> 00:26:10.905
i'm gonna put you down
like a dog.

00:26:10.935 --> 00:26:12.305
please.

00:26:12.335 --> 00:26:13.765
[ laughs ]

00:26:13.805 --> 00:26:17.265
you really think
you're better than me.

00:26:17.305 --> 00:26:19.065
[ laughs ]

00:26:19.105 --> 00:26:22.065
which one of you can cast
the first stone,huh?

00:26:22.135 --> 00:26:24.135
what about you,dean?

00:26:24.165 --> 00:26:27.065
you're practically
a walking billboard

00:26:27.105 --> 00:26:29.305
of gluttony and lust.

00:26:29.335 --> 00:26:32.735
and,tamara,
all that wrath.

00:26:32.765 --> 00:26:35.305
ooh. tsk,tsk,tsk,
tsk,tsk,tsk,tsk.

00:26:35.335 --> 00:26:37.465
it's the reason you and isaac
became hunters

00:26:37.505 --> 00:26:39.035
in the first place,
isn't it?

00:26:39.065 --> 00:26:43.035
it's so much easier
to drink in the rage

00:26:43.065 --> 00:26:47.005
than to face what really
happened all those years ago.

00:26:47.035 --> 00:26:48.365
aah!

00:26:49.435 --> 00:26:50.405
whew!

00:26:50.435 --> 00:26:52.735
[ laughs ]

00:26:56.005 --> 00:26:57.905
my point exactly.

00:26:57.935 --> 00:27:00.605
<i>and you call us sins.</i>

00:27:00.635 --> 00:27:02.435
we're not sins,man.

00:27:02.465 --> 00:27:05.635
we are natural
human instinct.

00:27:05.635 --> 00:27:08.735
and you can repress and deny us
all you want,

00:27:08.765 --> 00:27:13.035
but the truth is,
you are just animals.

00:27:14.335 --> 00:27:15.835
horny...

00:27:15.865 --> 00:27:17.735
greedy...

00:27:17.765 --> 00:27:19.565
hungry...

00:27:21.065 --> 00:27:22.605
...violent animals.

00:27:22.635 --> 00:27:24.405
and you know what?

00:27:24.435 --> 00:27:27.065
you'll be slaughtered
like animals,too.

00:27:32.465 --> 00:27:35.235
the others --

00:27:35.265 --> 00:27:37.905
they're coming for me.

00:27:37.935 --> 00:27:39.765
maybe.

00:27:41.935 --> 00:27:44.265
but they're not
gonna find you...

00:27:44.305 --> 00:27:45.965
'cause you'll be in hell.

00:27:49.965 --> 00:27:53.365
someone send
this clown packing.

00:27:53.405 --> 00:27:55.265
my pleasure.

00:28:01.005 --> 00:28:05.205
exorcizamus te,
omnis immundus spiritus,

00:28:05.235 --> 00:28:08.665
omnis satanica...
aaaaaaah!

00:28:08.705 --> 00:28:11.135
i don't think we're gonna have
to worry about hunting them.

00:28:11.165 --> 00:28:12.435
what does that mean?

00:28:12.465 --> 00:28:14.535
i think maybe
this joker's right.

00:28:14.565 --> 00:28:16.065
<i>they're gonna be
hunting us.</i>

00:28:16.105 --> 00:28:18.105
and they're not gonna
quit easy.

00:28:18.135 --> 00:28:19.635
you guys,
why don't you take tamara

00:28:19.665 --> 00:28:21.005
and head for the hills?

00:28:21.035 --> 00:28:23.405
i'll stay back,slow them down,
buy you a little time.

00:28:23.435 --> 00:28:24.705
sam:
you're insane,dean.

00:28:24.735 --> 00:28:26.165
just forget about it,okay?

00:28:26.205 --> 00:28:27.805
sam's rit.

00:28:29.205 --> 00:28:31.705
there's six of them,guys.

00:28:31.735 --> 00:28:33.405
we're outmanned,
we're outgunned.

00:28:33.435 --> 00:28:34.735
we'll be dead by dawn.

00:28:34.765 --> 00:28:38.035
maybe,but there's no place
to run that they won't find us.

00:28:38.065 --> 00:28:40.305
look,if we're going down,

00:28:40.335 --> 00:28:42.135
we're going down together,
all right?

00:28:44.565 --> 00:28:46.505
let's not make it easy
for them.

00:28:54.335 --> 00:28:56.305
demon's out
of the guy.

00:28:56.335 --> 00:28:57.535
and the guy?

00:28:57.565 --> 00:28:59.035
he didn't make it.

00:29:31.005 --> 00:29:33.135
here we go.

00:30:04.165 --> 00:30:07.235
isaac: tamara!

00:30:07.265 --> 00:30:09.705
tamara!

00:30:12.505 --> 00:30:15.965
tamara!

00:30:16.005 --> 00:30:18.265
tamara!

00:30:21.665 --> 00:30:25.605
help me! please!

00:30:31.905 --> 00:30:35.405
i got away,
but i'm hurt bad!

00:30:35.435 --> 00:30:36.555
i need help!

00:30:36.735 --> 00:30:39.765
it's not him.
it's one of those demons.

00:30:39.805 --> 00:30:41.805
it's possessing his corpse.

00:30:41.835 --> 00:30:43.735
[ knock on door ]
baby!

00:30:43.765 --> 00:30:46.735
why won't you let me in?

00:30:46.765 --> 00:30:49.365
you left me behind
back there.

00:30:50.665 --> 00:30:52.235
how could you do that?

00:30:52.265 --> 00:30:55.235
we swore...

00:30:55.265 --> 00:30:57.405
at that lake in michigan.

00:30:57.435 --> 00:30:58.805
remember?

00:30:58.835 --> 00:31:02.165
we swore we would never
leave each other!

00:31:02.205 --> 00:31:03.305
how did he know that?

00:31:03.335 --> 00:31:04.405
steady,tamara.

00:31:04.435 --> 00:31:07.065
you just gonna leave me
out here?

00:31:07.105 --> 00:31:10.235
you just gonna
let me die?!

00:31:12.435 --> 00:31:16.865
i guess that's what
you do,dear!

00:31:16.905 --> 00:31:20.535
like that night those things
came to our house...

00:31:21.935 --> 00:31:24.805
...came for our daughter!

00:31:24.835 --> 00:31:27.335
you just let her die,too.

00:31:27.365 --> 00:31:29.005
you son of a bitch!

00:31:29.035 --> 00:31:30.165
tamara,no!

00:31:33.505 --> 00:31:35.635
you're not isaac!

00:32:00.305 --> 00:32:04.135
fat,drunk,and stupid is no way
to go through life,son.

00:32:12.135 --> 00:32:16.905
exorcizamus te,omnis immundus
spiritus,omnis satanica...

00:32:22.835 --> 00:32:25.335
i suppose you're lust.

00:32:25.365 --> 00:32:27.605
baby,i'm whatever
you want me to be.

00:32:27.635 --> 00:32:28.835
just stay back.

00:32:28.865 --> 00:32:30.005
or what?

00:32:30.035 --> 00:32:31.935
good point.

00:32:31.965 --> 00:32:35.165
i'm not gonna hurt you --
not yet.

00:32:35.205 --> 00:32:38.165
not unless you want me to.

00:32:48.735 --> 00:32:50.705
here's johnny!

00:32:57.705 --> 00:32:59.335
come on.

00:32:59.365 --> 00:33:01.065
you really think something
like that

00:33:01.105 --> 00:33:02.765
is gonna fool someone
like me?

00:33:02.805 --> 00:33:05.005
<i>i mean,me?</i>

00:33:05.035 --> 00:33:07.035
let me guess --
you're pride.

00:33:14.105 --> 00:33:16.435
the root of all sin.

00:33:16.465 --> 00:33:18.435
and you...

00:33:18.465 --> 00:33:20.865
are sam winchester.

00:33:22.505 --> 00:33:24.035
that's right.
i've heard of you.

00:33:24.065 --> 00:33:25.665
<i>we've all heard of you.</i>

00:33:25.705 --> 00:33:29.905
the prodigy,the boy king.

00:33:29.935 --> 00:33:32.265
looking at you now,
i got to tell you,

00:33:32.305 --> 00:33:35.465
don't believe the hype.

00:33:35.505 --> 00:33:37.305
you think i'm gonna bow

00:33:37.335 --> 00:33:40.535
to a cut-rate,
piss-poor human like you?

00:33:40.565 --> 00:33:43.235
<i>i have my pride, after all.</i>

00:33:43.265 --> 00:33:46.235
and now with
your yellow-eyed friend dead,

00:33:46.265 --> 00:33:49.465
i guess i don't really have
to do a damn thing,now,do i?

00:33:49.505 --> 00:33:54.735
you're fair game now,boy,
and it's open season.

00:34:27.364 --> 00:34:28.765
you!

00:34:54.635 --> 00:34:56.735
who the hell are you?

00:34:56.765 --> 00:34:58.835
i'm the girl that just saved
your ass.

00:35:00.335 --> 00:35:01.835
well,i just
saved yours,too.

00:35:01.864 --> 00:35:04.765
[ chuckles ]
see you around,sam.

00:35:04.805 --> 00:35:06.465
wait!

00:35:40.414 --> 00:35:43.485
sam: think she's gonna be
all right?

00:35:43.515 --> 00:35:45.684
no. definitely not.

00:35:49.155 --> 00:35:51.684
<i>well,you look like hell
warmed over.</i>

00:35:51.715 --> 00:35:55.555
you try exorcising all night
and see how you feel.

00:35:55.585 --> 00:35:57.315
any survivors,bobby?

00:35:57.355 --> 00:35:59.285
well,the pretty girl
and the heavy guy,

00:35:59.315 --> 00:36:00.555
they'll make it.

00:36:00.585 --> 00:36:03.255
lifetime of therapy bills
ahead,but,still...

00:36:03.285 --> 00:36:05.755
that's more than you can say
for these poor bastards.

00:36:07.615 --> 00:36:09.914
bobby,that knife --

00:36:09.954 --> 00:36:11.715
what kind of blade
can kill a demon?

00:36:11.755 --> 00:36:14.355
yesterday,i would have said
there was no such thing.

00:36:14.385 --> 00:36:17.385
i'm just gonna ask it again --
who was that masked chick?

00:36:17.414 --> 00:36:19.215
actually,the more troubling
question would be,

00:36:19.255 --> 00:36:21.315
"how come a girl can fight
better than you?"

00:36:21.355 --> 00:36:23.755
three demons,dean...
at once.

00:36:23.785 --> 00:36:27.355
hey,whatever it takes to get
you through the night,pal.

00:36:27.385 --> 00:36:29.215
yeah,well,if you want
a troubling question,

00:36:29.255 --> 00:36:30.385
i got one for you --

00:36:30.414 --> 00:36:32.055
if we let out
the seven deadly sins,

00:36:32.085 --> 00:36:34.385
what else did we let out?

00:36:36.515 --> 00:36:38.454
<i>you're right.
that is troubling.</i>

00:36:49.615 --> 00:36:51.985
see you gents around.

00:36:52.015 --> 00:36:53.585
tamara?

00:36:55.684 --> 00:36:57.815
the world just got
a lot scarier.

00:36:57.855 --> 00:37:00.684
be careful.

00:37:00.715 --> 00:37:02.715
you too.

00:37:09.015 --> 00:37:11.715
keep your eyes peeled
for omens.

00:37:11.755 --> 00:37:13.015
i'll do the same.

00:37:13.055 --> 00:37:14.414
you got it.

00:37:14.454 --> 00:37:16.255
wait,bobby.

00:37:18.184 --> 00:37:20.885
we can win this war,
right?

00:37:29.414 --> 00:37:31.454
catch you
on the next one.

00:37:46.355 --> 00:37:47.954
so,where to?

00:37:49.755 --> 00:37:53.585
uh,i don't know.
i was thinking louisiana maybe.

00:37:53.615 --> 00:37:56.285
little early for mardi gras,
isn't it?
yeah.

00:37:56.315 --> 00:37:57.585
listen,
i was talking to tamara,

00:37:57.615 --> 00:37:59.115
and she mentioned
this hoodoo priestess

00:37:59.155 --> 00:38:01.184
outside of shreveport that might
be able to help us out,

00:38:01.215 --> 00:38:04.015
you know,with your --
with your demon deal.

00:38:04.055 --> 00:38:06.155
nah.

00:38:06.184 --> 00:38:09.085
"nah"?
what does that mean,"nah"?

00:38:09.115 --> 00:38:11.215
sam,no hoodoo spell's
gonna break this deal.

00:38:11.255 --> 00:38:12.215
it's a goose chase.

00:38:12.255 --> 00:38:13.355
we don't know that.
yes,we do.

00:38:13.385 --> 00:38:14.785
forget it.
she can't help.

00:38:14.815 --> 00:38:17.355
we're not going,
and that's that.

00:38:17.385 --> 00:38:19.184
what about reno,huh?

00:38:19.215 --> 00:38:21.585
you know what?

00:38:21.615 --> 00:38:23.015
i've had it.

00:38:23.055 --> 00:38:25.785
i've been bending over backwards
trying to be nice to you,

00:38:25.815 --> 00:38:27.954
and...i don't care anymore.

00:38:27.985 --> 00:38:29.055
that didn't last long.

00:38:29.085 --> 00:38:30.454
yeah,well,you know what?

00:38:30.485 --> 00:38:33.015
i've been busting my ass
trying to keep you alive,dean,

00:38:33.055 --> 00:38:34.755
and you act like
you couldn't care less.

00:38:34.785 --> 00:38:36.755
what,you got some kind of
death wish or something?

00:38:36.785 --> 00:38:37.914
it's not like that.

00:38:37.954 --> 00:38:39.015
then what's it like,dean?

00:38:39.055 --> 00:38:40.155
sam --
please,tell me.

00:38:42.914 --> 00:38:45.855
we trap the crossroads demon,
trick it,

00:38:45.885 --> 00:38:48.085
try to welsh our way
out of the deal in any way,

00:38:48.115 --> 00:38:51.115
you die,okay?

00:38:51.155 --> 00:38:52.355
you die.

00:38:52.385 --> 00:38:54.885
those are the terms.
there's no way out of it.

00:38:54.914 --> 00:38:56.255
if you try to find a way,

00:38:56.285 --> 00:38:58.215
so help me god,
i'm gonna stop you.

00:39:02.155 --> 00:39:03.454
[ sighs ]

00:39:03.485 --> 00:39:04.985
how could you make
that deal,dean?

00:39:06.355 --> 00:39:08.215
'cause i couldn't live
with you dead.

00:39:08.255 --> 00:39:09.414
couldn't do it.

00:39:09.454 --> 00:39:11.655
so,what,
now i live and you die?

00:39:11.684 --> 00:39:13.015
that's the general idea,
yeah.

00:39:13.055 --> 00:39:15.585
yeah,well,
you're a hypocrite,dean.

00:39:15.615 --> 00:39:17.655
how did you feel when dad
sold his soul for you?

00:39:17.684 --> 00:39:19.454
'cause i was there.
i remember.

00:39:19.485 --> 00:39:21.815
you were twisted and broken.

00:39:21.855 --> 00:39:26.555
and now you go and do
the same thing...to me.

00:39:26.585 --> 00:39:28.485
what you did was selfish.

00:39:28.515 --> 00:39:31.855
<i>yeah,you're right.
it was selfish.</i>

00:39:31.885 --> 00:39:33.184
but i'm okay with that.

00:39:33.215 --> 00:39:34.914
i'm not.
tough.

00:39:34.954 --> 00:39:36.684
after everything i've done
for this family,

00:39:36.715 --> 00:39:37.715
i think i'm entitled.

00:39:39.085 --> 00:39:41.885
truth is,i'm tired,sam.

00:39:41.914 --> 00:39:43.255
i don't know,

00:39:43.285 --> 00:39:45.454
it's like there's a light
at the end of the tunnel.

00:39:45.485 --> 00:39:46.454
it's hellfire,dean.

00:39:46.485 --> 00:39:48.055
whatever.

00:39:48.085 --> 00:39:49.715
you're alive,
i feel good...

00:39:49.755 --> 00:39:52.715
for the first time
in a long time.

00:39:52.755 --> 00:39:56.655
i got a year to live,sam.
i'd like to make the most of it.

00:39:56.684 --> 00:39:58.715
so what do you say we kill
some evil sons of bitches

00:39:58.755 --> 00:40:00.655
and we raise
a little hell,huh?

00:40:03.855 --> 00:40:06.184
you're unbelievable.

00:40:06.215 --> 00:40:08.914
very true.



00:00:0.500 --> 00:00:2.00
